networks and datastores lie at the datacenter level. clusters is a group of esxi hosts.folders are used to organize vms within each cluster.  

packages needed for ansible to function

1> dnf install open-vm-tools; systemctl start vmtoolsd;systemctl enable vmtoolsd
2> dnf install python3,python3-pip
3> pip3 install pyVmomi
4> ansible-galaxy collection install community.vmware
